            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing Emry, Lurker of the Loch's ability to cast artifacts from the graveyard to assemble a powerful combo. It includes a variety of cheap artifacts like Mox Opal, Everflowing Chalice, and Ornithopter to quickly fill the graveyard and generate value. Cards like Thopter Foundry and Sword of the Meek create an infinite token combo, while Grinding Station and Pyrite Spellbomb offer alternate win conditions. Counterspells and disruption help protect the combo pieces, while cards like Tormod's Crypt and Soul-Guide Lantern provide graveyard hate against opposing strategies. By efficiently recurring artifacts and assembling combos, the deck aims to overwhelm opponents and win through a variety of different avenues."
